This product includes the following bundled components:

- kumorfm/_vendor/kumopql: PQL parser vendored from the kumo-pql project
  (NVIDIA), including parser code generated by ANTLR 4.9.3
  (https://github.com/antlr/antlr4, BSD-3-Clause runtime dependency
  antlr4-python3-runtime).
- The kumorfm native extension (kumolib) is built with pybind11
  (https://github.com/pybind/pybind11, BSD-3-Clause), used at build time.

All other third-party dependencies are declared in each package's
pyproject.toml / setup.py and are installed from PyPI under their
respective licenses.
